 2026 to nearly 29,091/sq. ft now. Presently, 2 properties are available for purchase through owners and dealers, offering multiple options to explore. Chandak Treesourus, Narang Vivenda, Mahindra Marina64, Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara, Ruparel Stardom are some nearby under-construction projects. Transcon Auris Serenity, Raj Infinia, K Raheja Interface Heights, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave, Transcon & Sheth Auris Bliss are completed residential societies available nearby.\n\n### How is the Malad West Real Estate Market?\n\n During the July 2026 quarter, the average pricing for multistorey apartments in Malad West is noted at Rs. 22,130/sq. ft, and the price range spans from Rs. 16,853 to Rs. 27,408/sq. ft, covering diverse budget preferences. Rental yield for residential properties in Malad West, Mumbai is currently 3.56%. Going by 383 reviews shared by residents, Malad West maintains a rating of 4.07/5.For shopping and entertainment, you can visit World of Titan Infiniti mall and Mothercare. Veer Bhagat Singh Vidyalaya and Atharva Institute of Management Studies are among the trusted schools available within walking distance of the project.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nPark\n\nReserved Parking\n\nService/Goods Lift\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\nKids Club\n\nDTH Television Facility\n\nWater Storage\n\nWaste Disposal\n\n## Ratings & Reviews\n\n for Malad West\n\nLocality\n\n4.1\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(383 Total Reviews)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nEnvironment\n\n4/5\n\nNeighbourhood\n\nRoads\n\nSafety\n\nCleanliness\n\nCommuting\n\n3.8/5\n\nPublic Transport\n\nParking\n\nConnectivity\n\nTraffic\n\nPlaces of Interest\n\n4.5/5\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nRestaurants\n\nMarkets\n\nLocality Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n17/02/2026\n\nHigh-end Suburb for Families Malad West offers\n\nHigh-end Suburb for Families Malad West offers a strong social infrastructure. Good schools, reputed... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner